flowchart TD
    subgraph Network[Network only when needed]
        HF[Hugging Face pinned GGUF]
        Mirror[Catalog mirror fallback]
        Cloud[Optional configured text provider]
    end
    subgraph Local[User computer]
        Picker[React model picker] --> Manager[Rust ModelManager]
        HF --> Check[Size and SHA-256 verification]
        Mirror --> Check
        Check --> Cache[Local model cache]
        Manager --> Cache
        Mic[Shortcut and microphone] --> Audio[16 kHz audio frames]
        Audio --> Runtime[transcribe-cpp Nemotron session]
        Cache --> Runtime
        Runtime --> Preview[Live partial text overlay]
        Runtime --> Finalize[Release shortcut and finalize]
        Finalize -->|Empty or failed stream where safe| Batch[Same-model batch transcription]
        Batch --> Text[Final text]
        Finalize --> Text
        Text --> Cleanup[Local cleanup and custom words]
        Cleanup --> Snippets[Local voice snippet matcher]
        Library[Local saved snippets] --> Snippets
        Snippets -->|Matched: exact saved text| Paste[Clipboard and paste into active app]
        Snippets -->|No match, provider disabled| Paste
    end
    Snippets -. No match and cloud post-processing enabled .-> Cloud
    Cloud -. Processed text .-> Paste
